# Baby Crocolisk from the Sewer Beast in Stormwind's canals (new in Forever).
# Sources: Forever's drop data, item 282047 (Sewer Beast, 1.5% in 132 kills);
# npcs.json (the Sewer Beast's spawns); Forever client 1.60.1.70338.

step Sewer Beast
  tip The Sewer Beast is a rare level 50 crocolisk that swims Stormwind's canals; early kill counts give about 1.5% per kill. It is friendly to nobody: Horde players can farm it too, but they are in an enemy capital.
  collect 282047 "Baby Crocolisk" @32.4,62.5 -- Sewer Beast
